<title>USA: McDonald's to name division presidents - WSJ.</title>
<headline>McDonald's to name division presidents - WSJ.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>McDonald's Corp is expected to name five new division presidents on Wednesday to be responsible for increasing domestic business, The Wall Street Journal said.</p>
<p>In Wednesday's electronic edition, the paper said the new division presidents would replace eight zone managers.</p>
<p>The newspaper quoted a company spokesman who confirmed that a major announcement was forthcoming.</p>
